# Hooks Internals

Coming soon — this page explains how Reactor's hooks actually work
under the hood: the hook slot table, the dispatcher / current-component
pattern, closure capture and the "stale state" problem, how `UseEffect`
queues, how `UseMemo` keys, how `UseRef` differs. Promotes the
existing `docs/reference/state-and-hooks.md` once authored. See
[the AI Author Skill](../../_pipeline/ai-author-skill.md) for the
planned surface.

Until then, [Hooks](hooks.md) covers the surface model.
